diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 838b282..f509fbf 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,8 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- Month files are written as format 2: every amount is a decimal string such as `"382.10"`
+  instead of integer cents. Format 1 files from earlier closes are still read.
 - New `paid_in_out` statement layout for exports with `Paid in` and `Paid out` columns.
 - `contains` rules match whole words only; the new `anywhere` match kind keeps the old
   behaviour of matching inside words.
